+  "more_reads_html": "For more planning help, explore a <a href=\"https://blog.bluestone.com/birthday-gift-guide-perfect-picks-for-every-personality/\">gift guide by personality</a>, review <a href=\"https://blog.bluestone.com/bangle-size-2026/\">bangle sizing before choosing a fitted gift</a>, learn <a href=\"https://blog.bluestone.com/how-to-check-gold-purity-2026/\">how to check gold purity</a>, see <a href=\"https://blog.bluestone.com/karwa-chauth-gift-for-wife-2026/\">jewellery gifting ideas for a wife</a>, or browse <a href=\"https://blog.bluestone.com/best-gift-for-sister-on-raksha-bandhan-2026/\">thoughtful gifts for a sister</a>.",
