+# Week 6 Rank 5 structure and visual concept
+
+## Article brief
+
+* Engine: gift_guide
+* Content mode: product led wedding gifting guide
+* Title A: Wedding Gifts for Girls in 2026: Thoughtful Jewellery Ideas
+* Title B for later same URL CTR testing: Best Wedding Gifts for Girls in 2026: Jewellery She Will Treasure
+* Slug: wedding-gifts-for-girls-2026
+* Meta title: Wedding Gifts for Girls in 2026 | BlueStone
+* Meta description: Discover thoughtful wedding gifts for girls in 2026, with jewellery ideas by style, relationship and occasion, plus six BlueStone picks.
+* Author: Vikas, WordPress user 270271338
+* Categories: Gift 554493424; Wedding Jewellery 554493443
+* Target visible length: 2,400 to 3,000 words
+* Commerce approach: one useful mid article carousel with six approved products, followed by six editorial recommendations with distinct gift reasons. No prices.
+
+## Ordered structure
+
+1. Direct answer and TL;DR
+2. Wedding Gifts for Girls in 2026: Quick Picks
