+# Week 6 Rank 5 structure and visual concept
+
+## Article brief
+
+* Engine: gift_guide
+* Content mode: product led wedding gifting guide
+* Title A: Wedding Gifts for Girls in 2026: Thoughtful Jewellery Ideas
+* Title B for later same URL CTR testing: Best Wedding Gifts for Girls in 2026: Jewellery She Will Treasure
+* Slug: wedding-gifts-for-girls-2026
+* Meta title: Wedding Gifts for Girls in 2026 | BlueStone
+* Meta description: Discover thoughtful wedding gifts for girls in 2026, with jewellery ideas by style, relationship and occasion, plus six BlueStone picks.
+* Author: Vikas, WordPress user 270271338
+* Categories: Gift 554493424; Wedding Jewellery 554493443
+* Target visible length: 2,400 to 3,000 words
+* Commerce approach: one useful mid article carousel with six approved products, followed by six editorial recommendations with distinct gift reasons. No prices.
+
+## Ordered structure
+
+1. Direct answer and TL;DR
+2. Wedding Gifts for Girls in 2026: Quick Picks
+3. How to Choose a Wedding Gift She Will Actually Wear
+4. Wedding Jewellery Gift Ideas by Personal Style
+5. BlueStone Wedding Gifts for Girls: 6 Thoughtful Picks
+6. Six product carousel within the recommendation section
+7. Meaningful Wedding Gifts From Parents, Siblings, and Friends
+8. Safe Wedding Gift Ideas When You Are Unsure of Her Style
+9. How to Make a Jewellery Gift Feel Personal
+10. Wedding Gifting Mistakes to Avoid
+11. More BlueStone wedding and gifting guides
+12. Conclusion with a soft category nudge
+13. Frequently Asked Questions About Wedding Gifts for Girls
+
+## Visual concept
+
+Model: nano_banana_pro, 16:9, 2k, one result per slot.
+
+Flatlay setting: `marble-vanity`. The previous generated Week 6 rank used `desk-kraft`, so this setting does not repeat consecutively. Props will be a silk ribbon, a small jewellery tray, rose petals, and a closed gift box with no readable marks.
+
+### Hero
+
+* Candidate product: BVPJ0935C06, The Shubhlatika Mangalsutra Necklace
+* Body image gate: passed, `ProductImages/raw/Mangalsutra Chains/The Shubhlatika Mangalsutra Necklace/1_body_portrait.png`
+* Design reference: `ProductImages/raw/Mangalsutra Chains/The Shubhlatika Mangalsutra Necklace/0_primary.png`
+* Scene: a fair skinned Indian bride in a softly lit home dressing area receives a wrapped jewellery box from her sister. The bride already wears the Shubhlatika Mangalsutra at true scale. The exchange feels intimate and editorial, with faces and upper bodies in frame.
+* Intent: a meaningful wedding gifting moment that puts the recipient relationship first.
+
+### Flatlay
+
+* Candidate product: BIPM0017R18, The Malibu Ring
+* References: primary, front, side, and close up packshots
+* Scene: top down marble vanity flatlay with the Malibu Ring at true scale, a silk ribbon, small velvet tray, rose petals, and a closed unbranded gift box. No card, text, screen, or logo.
+* Caption: The Malibu Ring styled as an elegant wedding keepsake for a bride who loves statement jewellery
+
+### Lifestyle
+
+* Candidate product: BIAV0865V24, The Pervinca Charm Holder Bracelet
+* Body image gate: passed, `ProductImages/raw/Bracelets/The Pervinca Charm Holder Bracelet/1_body_portrait.png`
+* Design reference: `ProductImages/raw/Bracelets/The Pervinca Charm Holder Bracelet/0_primary.png`
+* Scene: a fair skinned Indian bride and her best friend share a candid laugh while fastening the Pervinca Charm Holder Bracelet on the bride's wrist. The bracelet is physically worn at true scale, with the wrist, hands, and both faces visible.
+* Caption: The Pervinca Charm Holder Bracelet as a personal wedding gift from a close friend
+
+## Visual restrictions
+
+* People shots use exactly two references: body image first, design image second.
+* All three products have Female GenderTag and appear only on adult women.
+* Product dimensions use product height and product width language only. They are jewellery dimensions, not face or body measurements.
+* No phones, screens, cards, boards, placards, readable text, logos, or product size wording tied to the wearer's face.
+* No floating product overlays, extra jewellery, oversized jewellery, cropped faces, cropped hands, or distorted fingers.
+* Every prompt uses the required analog grain, Kodak Portra color science, highlight halation, creamy bokeh, filmic tonal response, editorial color grading, and natural dynamic range language.
+* Featured hero is not repeated in the body.
+
+## Keyword provenance
+
+The Week 6 CSV supplies only the primary keyword and its metrics. Related phrases and every non primary section are intent inferred. No competitor URL was supplied or used.
